# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The previous client's artwork. This site was built on a cinematic engine
# that shipped with another person's reference photography, video and
# typography. None of it is ours to redistribute, so none of it is committed.
#
# Consequence worth knowing: tools/build_media.py's build_grunge() and the
# extract_s*.py scripts read these, so those specific steps cannot be re-run
# from a fresh clone. Everything the site actually serves is committed, and
# the whole asset pipeline for THIS site's own material runs fine without them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
